US", "item_id": "7550446554335694094", "raw": "Griffin", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@officialdonovancatholic/video/7550446554335694094", "title": "We did it! 🎉 We saved the Griffin! 🎉 Thank you to all of our amazing donors who made this possible. We officially have a new Griffin…new mascot, same Donovan pride! 💙🦅 #NewMascot #SaveTheGriffin #DonovanCatholic #DonovanCatholicHighSchool", "description": "We did it! 🎉 We saved the Griffin! 🎉 Thank you to all of our amazing donors who made this possible. We officially have a new Griffin…new mascot, same Donovan pride! 💙🦅 #NewMascot #SaveTheGriffin #DonovanCatholic #DonovanCatholicHighSchool", "hashtags": ["#NewMascot", "#SaveTheGriffin", "#DonovanCatholic", "#DonovanCatholicHighSchool"], "author": "@officialdonovancatholic", "views": 2114.0, "text": "", "text_source": "none"}, {"ts": "2026-08-19T09:22:33.933+00:00", "run": "092233", "source": "tiktok", "region": "US", "item_id": "7462444991244291370", "raw": "Redhawk", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@newson6kotv/video/7462444991244291370", "title": "Union High School unveiled its new costumed mascot, Rocket the Redhawk, during a pep assembly Tuesday morning at the Union Multipurpose Activity Center. Approximately 3,500 high school students gathered for Rocket’s debut, marking the final step in the district’s transition to the Redhawks mascot. The change began in 2021 when the district retired its previous mascot. Students selected Redhawks as the new mascot, and the logo design, created by 11th grader Caiden Morales, was approved in 2022. To name the costumed mascot, students were invited to submit suggestions, with Rocket emerging as the favorite. #oklahoma #news #highscoolsports #newmascot ", "description": "Union High School unveiled its new costumed mascot, Rocket the Redhawk, during a pep assembly Tuesday morning at the Union Multipurpose Activity Center. Approximately 3,500 high school students gathered for Rocket’s debut, marking the final step in the district’s transition to the Redhawks mascot. The change began in 2021 when the district retired its previous mascot. Students selected Redhawks as the new mascot, and the logo design, created by 11th grader Caiden Morales, was approved in 2022. To name the costumed mascot, students were invited to submit suggestions, with Rocket emerging as the favorite. #oklahoma #news #highscoolsports #newmascot ", "hashtags": ["#oklahoma", "#news", "#highscoolsports", "#newmascot"], "author": "@newson6kotv", "views": 8711.0, "text": "", "text_source": "none"}, {"ts": "2026-08-19T09:22:33.933+00:00", "run": "092233", "source": "tiktok", "region": "GB", "item_id": "7653965296667200770", "raw": "Evan", "url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@london_colney.fc/video/7653965296667200770", "title": "⚽🔵 Introducing London Colney's New Mascot – Evan! 🔵⚽ Everyone at London Colney is delighted to welcome our newest mascot, Evan! 💙 With a huge smile, plenty of confidence, and proudly wearing the famous blue and white colours, Evan is already showing what it means to be part of the London Colney family. From leading on the players to cheering in the stands, he's ready to bring energy, excitement, and plenty of team spirit to every matchday. Evan's passion for football shines through, and we can't wait to see him leading the fans, encouraging the team, and creating unforgettable memories throughout the season. Make sure to give Evan a big London Colney welcome when you see him around the club! 👏⚽ #LondonColney #NewMascot #FutureBlueboy #FootballFamily #GrassrootsFootball", "description": "⚽🔵 Introducing London Colney's New Mascot – Evan! 🔵⚽ Everyone at London Colney is delighted to welcome our newest mascot, Evan! 💙 With a huge smile, plenty of confidence, and proudly wearing the famous blue and white colours, Evan is already showing what it means to be part of the London Colney family. From leading on the players to cheering in the stands, he's ready to bring energy, excitement, and plenty of team spirit to 